      "id": 1,
      "text": "Beaverdale adopted its name in 1917 after a neighboring village claimed the Urbandale name, spurred by the 1907 Urbandale Improvement League.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
