      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The neighborhood’s signature Beaverdale Brick homes, built by local contractor E.T. starting in 1938, blend Tudor and Colonial Revival styles.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Beaverdale_Des_Moines",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Three city parks—Ashby, Beaverdale, and Witmer—serve the neighborhood, with Ashby Park covering 10.5 acres.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
